Package: org.dayuzou.airtuneshall-disable
Name: CoolBooterAudioFix
Version: 1.0.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Fixes music stuttering and lag on CoolBooter iOS 6 setups by disabling the broken AirPlay HAL plugin to bypass sandbox write locks.
Maintainer: Dayu Zou
Author: Dayu Zou
Section: System
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
